    "The earlier good-speed-ideal/zero results are not asserted under these broader hypotheses."
  ],
  "completed_deductions": [
    "The original coordinate partial decomposes into finitely many coefficient derivations of A plus a vertical part. Evaluation at s=-v/h gives a derivation D_* of A_h sending r=w-gv²/(2h) to1, without inverting g.",
