    "Evaluating the coordinate differential at s0 gives j(dw)+(gv)=A. At a closed point g0, the exact pointwise covector constraints in the differential note hold; they do not make g reduced.",
    "For every λ, A embeds in Bλ=B/(z-λ)≅C3 by positive s-degree. The generic localization is a quadratic field, hence -gLλ is a nonzero nonsquare in Frac A.",
    "Primitivity of every coordinate equation gives gcd_A(g,w-λ)=1, and therefore gcd_Ah(g,Lλ)=1. A squarefree Lλ does not imply a squarefree raw discriminant -gLλ.",
    "The actual repeated-common-factor action g=(a-1)² has polynomial inverse pairs, global slice, h=a³ and Lλ at a1 equal to -2(V+λ). It exhibits a genuine repeated raw discriminant factor.",
    "The actual two-speed localized base C[a±1,b±1,c] has smooth r quadratic in c. Every LND fixes units a,b, so no LND can send r to1. Smooth critical value does not imply an LND slice.",
    "On R=A_h, Bλ_h=R[y]/(g y²+Lλ) is the exact saturated affine modification Sλ[Y/g] of Sλ=R[Y]/(Y²+gLλ). It is not automatically a normalization or a polynomial presentation of R.",
    "The checked residual-coordinate and Das cancellation statements retain actual base and relative-dimension hypotheses not supplied here. No source recognition theorem was established."
